{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01XksJQ2KmQNbWSBUMSrrM8W","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"CoRL 2023 reviewer guidelines rating scale scoring criteria\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"Reviewer Guidelines — CoRL 2023\",\"url\":\"https://www.corl2023.org/reviewer-guidelines\"},{\"title\":\"CoRL 2023 Statistics - Paper Copilot\",\"url\":\"https://papercopilot.com/statistics/corl-statistics/corl-2023-statistics/\"},{\"title\":\"CoRL 2024 - Instruction for Reviews\",\"url\":\"https://2024.corl.org/contributions/instruction-for-reviews\"},{\"title\":\"ICLR 2023 Reviewer Guide\",\"url\":\"https://iclr.cc/Conferences/2023/ReviewerGuide\"},{\"title\":\"Grant Peer Review: Improving Inter-Rater Reliability with Training\",\"url\":\"https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pmc/articles/PMC4468126/\"},{\"title\":\"Best Reviewers Award for 2023\",\"url\":\"https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pmc/articles/PMC10957073/\"},{\"title\":\"CoRL 2023 Accepted Paper List - Paper Copilot\",\"url\":\"https://papercopilot.com/paper-list/corl-paper-list/corl-2023-paper-list/\"},{\"title\":\"Reviewers in 2023\",\"url\":\"https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pmc/articles/PMC10965321/\"}]\n\nBased on the search results, I found the CoRL 2023 Reviewer Guidelines page. Here's what the guidelines emphasize regarding reviewer criteria and scoring:\n\nCoRL papers are required to include a limitations section. Reviewers are asked to treat honestly reported limitations kindly and with high appreciation. However, obvious shortcomings or flaws not reported by the authors should be pointed out extensively and be strongly reflected in scores.\n\nThe guidelines also provide guidance on review quality: Reviewers should generally be constructive and concrete; be courteous and respectful. Reviews should start with the positive aspects, suggest improvements, and accept diverse views in a discussion (e.g. agree to disagree).\n\nThe search results include the CoRL 2023 reviewer guidelines page, but the specific rating scale and detailed scoring criteria are not fully shown in the available excerpts. For the complete detailed rating scale and scoring criteria, you may need to visit the full page at https://www.corl2023.org/reviewer-guidelines.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"2be1a920-1f7c-4c94-bc45-d01d7138d885","uuid":"f1496be3-d3eb-4653-82e9-9caa244afe07","timestamp":"2026-05-20T16:44:03.913Z","tool_use_result":{"query":"CoRL 2023 reviewer guidelines rating scale scoring criteria","results":[{"tool_use_id":"srvtoolu_01LgSb2rkExuy2SVedB7v4Yd","content":[{"title":"Reviewer Guidelines — CoRL 2023","url":"https://www.corl2023.org/reviewer-guidelines"},{"title":"CoRL 2023 Statistics - Paper Copilot","url":"https://papercopilot.com/statistics/corl-statistics/corl-2023-statistics/"},{"title":"CoRL 2024 - Instruction for Reviews","url":"https://2024.corl.org/contributions/instruction-for-reviews"},{"title":"ICLR 2023 Reviewer Guide","url":"https://iclr.cc/Conferences/2023/ReviewerGuide"},{"title":"Grant Peer Review: Improving Inter-Rater Reliability with Training","url":"https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pmc/articles/PMC4468126/"},{"title":"Best Reviewers Award for 2023","url":"https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pmc/articles/PMC10957073/"},{"title":"CoRL 2023 Accepted Paper List - Paper Copilot","url":"https://papercopilot.com/paper-list/corl-paper-list/corl-2023-paper-list/"},{"title":"Reviewers in 2023","url":"https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pmc/articles/PMC10965321/"}]},"Based on the search results, I found the CoRL 2023 Reviewer Guidelines page. Here's what the guidelines emphasize regarding reviewer criteria and scoring:\n\nCoRL papers are required to include a limitations section. Reviewers are asked to treat honestly reported limitations kindly and with high appreciation. However, obvious shortcomings or flaws not reported by the auth