{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01YVPbzyjFT3AMQDe1mefgFV","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"success\\\": true, \\\"data\\\": {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-be-idea-gen-0515-2/projects/importance_margin_vla_compress/report.md\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"# Handover — 2026-05-20\\\\n\\\\n> 由 Agent 生成，每次状态变更后自动更新。硬限 150 行。\\\\n\\\\n## 运行中\\\\n| exp_id | 假设 | 状态 | 关键指标 | W&B |\\\\n|--------|------|------|---------|-----|\\\\n| eval_openvla_prune_random_k05_seed43_v2 | OpenVLA random pruning at k=0.5 with seed=43 verifies reproducibility of seed=7 result (37.4% SR). Retry with correct script (eval_openvla_libero.py). If seed43 ≈ 37.4%, confirms graded degradation pattern is robust across seeds. | — | — | — |\\\\n| eval_openvla_prune_random_k07_seed43_v2 | OpenVLA random pruning at k=0.7 with seed=43 verifies reproducibility of seed=7 result (49% SR). Retry with correct script (eval_openvla_libero.py). If seed43 ≈ 49%, confirms graded degradation pattern is robust across seeds. | — | — | — |\\\\n| eval_openvla_prune_random_k05_seed43 | OpenVLA random pruning at k=0.5 with seed=43 verifies reproducibility of seed=7 result (37.4% SR). If seed43 ≈ 37.4%, confirms graded degradation pattern is robust across seeds. | — | — | — |\\\\n\\\\n## 待处理\\\\n- eval_openvla_prune_seed43_sweep: OpenVLA-OFT random pruning seed=43 sweep (k=0.7, k=0.5) to verify reproducibility of seed=7 results. If seed43 results match seed=7 (k=0.7→49%, k=0.5→37.4%), confirms graded degradation pattern is robust across seeds.（准备中）\\\\n- eval_openvla_prune_l2norm_sweep: OpenVLA L2 norm pruning eval (k=0.7/0.5/0.3) on LIBERO-Object. Unifies pruning method with X-VLA (both use L2 norm-based token selection). L2NormPruningHook: after projector output, sort vision tokens by L2 norm, keep top-k highest norm tokens (true removal, spatial order preserved). If L2 norm curve differs significantly from random removal curve (k=0.7: 49%, k=0.5: 37.4%, k=0.3: 20.6%), demonstrates importance-aware pruning matters for MLP projector.（准备中）\\\\n- analysis_smolvla_importance_cv: SmolVLA (pixel-shuffle connector) token importance CV analysis. D103 verification: if SmolVLA CV is low like π0 (0.038), entropy+CV cannot distinguish compressible/non-compressible; if high, CV is a useful predictor of connector behavior.（准备中）\\\\n- analysis_pi0_token_importance: π0 (3.3B, 256 tokens, linear projection) token importance analysis. Same token count as OpenVLA (256) but different connector (linear vs 3-layer MLP). If π0 pruning curve is flat like X-VLA (64 tokens, linear), confirms connector type — not token count — determines compressibility.（准备中）\\\\n- train_openvla_sc_m64_seed42: OpenVLA VTC-only M=64 (256→64 tokens, 75% compression). M-sweep data point between M=96 and M=32. If M=64 SR > M=32 SR, confirms monotonic degradation for MLP-projector VTC re-encoding at higher compression ratios on OpenVLA. Retry of vtconly variant after D096 approved early M-sweep start.（准备中）\\\\n- train_openvla_sc_m96_seed42: OpenVLA VTC-only M=96 (256→96 tokens, 62.5% compression). M-sweep data point between M=128 and M=64. If M=96 SR falls between M=128 and M=64 SR, confirms graded degradation pattern for MLP-projector VTC re-encoding on OpenVLA. Retry of vtconly variant after D096 approved early M-sweep start.（准备中）\\\\n- c5_roboflamingo_libero_object（准备中）\\\\n- c5-roboflamingo-libero-baseline（准备中）\\\\n- debug_obs_official（准备中）\\\\n- eval_official_smolvla_prune_k05（准备中）\\\\n- …另有 6 项\\\\n\\\\n## 近期结论\\\\n- **eval_oft_baseline_k10** (failed): OFT model without pruning (k=1.0) should achieve ~74% SR on libero_object if the eval pipeline is correct; if SR=0% then the OFT pruning sweep results (k=0.95=0%, k=0.9=0%) are due to a model loading/inference bug, not catastrophic pruning sensitivity.\\\\n- **eval_openvla_sc_m128_20k_seed42** (negative): OpenVLA with Smart Compress M=128 at 20K steps achieves competitive success rate on LIBERO-Object (C4-ext checkpoint), validating that VTC-only compression preserves action prediction quality\\\\n- **eval_smart_compress_m16_seed44** (success): Eval of M=16 seed44 (v3 training) checkpoint on LIBERO-Object (50 eps/task). Third seed for extreme compression point (87.5%). Prior: seed42=55.8%. Completes 3-seed data for M=16 on M-curve. ← 基于 train_smart_compress_m16_seed44_v3\\\\n\\\\n## 趋势\\\\n成功 77 / 负向 25 / 失败 28 / 共 141\\\\nn_queries: 16 ↓（近 3 次 success）\\\\noverall_sr: 0.565 ↑（近 3 次 success）\\\\n\\\\n## 下一步\\\\n（无活跃 idea，请通过 ideas.md 添加）\\\\n\\\\n## 资源状态\\\\ncqa1-33015: 无 GPU 信息\\\\nwestd-27271: 无 GPU 信息\\\\nwestd-38929: 无 GPU 信息\\\\nwestd-41074: 无 GPU 信息\\\\n\\\\n## 告警\\\\n- mvp_baseline: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n- mvp_imm_anchor: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n- mvp_baseline_v2: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n- mvp_imm_anchor_v2: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n- mvp_baseline_v3: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n- mvp_imm_anchor_v4: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n- mvp_baseline_v4: 已被终止 — unknown\\\\n- mvp_imm_anchor_v5: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n- mvp_imm_anchor_v6: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n- mvp_imm_anchor_v7: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n- mvp_imm_anchor_v7_1: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n- plan_008_pruning_sweep: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n- libero_imm_twostage_v1: 已被终止 — unknown\\\\n- libero_fullft_batch64: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n- eval_k07_bypass_v2: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n- eval_stage1only_spatial: 已被终止 — unknown\\\\n- libero_fullft_batch64_v2: 已被终止 — unknown\\\\n- train_acis_stage1only_k03: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n- eval_openvla_pruning_k03: 已被终止 — unknown\\\\n- train_smart_compress_m128: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n- train_baseline_control_100k: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n- eval_official_smolvla_pruning: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n- eval_acis_k05_supplement_200eps: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n- eval_smart_compress_m96_seed43: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n- train_smart_compress_m16_seed44: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n- eval_smolvla_prune_k05_spatial: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n- eval_smolvla_official_baseline_spatial: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n- eval_official_smolvla_prune_k05_spatial: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n- train_smart_compress_m16_seed44_v2: